<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>$(DEVELOPMENT_LANGUAGE)</string>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>RizeDijital</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>APPL</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>$(MARKETING_VERSION)</string>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>$(CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION)</string>
	<key>LSRequiresIPhoneOS</key>
	<true/>
	<key>UILaunchStoryboardName</key>
	<string>LaunchScreen</string>
	<key>UIMainStoryboardFile</key>
	<string>Main</string>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
	</array>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations~ipad</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortraitUpsideDown</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
	</array>
	<key>UIViewControllerBasedStatusBarAppearance</key>
	<true/>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>RizeDijital, yakınınızdaki şehir hizmetlerini ve konuma bağlı içerikleri göstermek için konumunuzu yalnızca uygulamayı kullanırken kullanır.</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>RizeDijital, Akış hikâyelerinde fotoğraf ve en fazla 60 saniyelik video çekebilmeniz için kameraya yalnızca siz kamerayı kullanmayı seçtiğinizde erişir.</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>RizeDijital, sesli arama ve Hikâye video kaydı sırasında sesi algılamak ve kaydetmek için mikrofonu yalnızca ilgili özelliği kullandığınızda kullanır.</string>
	<key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>RizeDijital, sesli arama ifadenizi metne dönüştürmek için konuşma tanımayı kullanır.</string>
	<key>UIBackgroundModes</key>
	<array>
		<string>remote-notification</string>
	</array>
	<key>CFBundleURLTypes</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>CFBundleURLName</key>
			<string>com.rizedijital.app</string>
			<key>CFBundleURLSchemes</key>
			<array>
				<string>rizedijital</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>LSApplicationQueriesSchemes</key>
	<array>
		<string>whatsapp</string>
		<string>comgooglemaps</string>
		<string>maps</string>
	</array>
	<key>OneSignal_app_groups_key</key>
	<string>group.com.rizedijital.app.onesignal</string>
	<key>NSAppTransportSecurity</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSAllowsArbitraryLoads</key>
		<false/>
	</dict>
</dict>
</plist>
